"For each item below, fetch its source and check that the recorded quote appears on the page and supports the item. A card item is a field of the plan in the producer's words, with the sources it cites: check each factual claim in it against those sources, and any value it carries against the page; what the plan will build, measure or predict needs no source, but a factual claim with no source is UNSUPPORTED. For a cost input, check that the page states the number for the setting given; whether it applies to this plan is not yours to judge. When the page states a different number for a num or rate item, give it as page_value. Decide only from the pages you fetch and the text below; do not read files. Return one status per item, under its ref: SUPPORTED, PARTIAL, UNSUPPORTED, CONTRADICTED or UNREACHABLE, with the page sentence you relied on.
Items, one per line:
{\"ref\":\"card:question\",\"text\":\"Can 54000 versus 3600 rotations improve best50 DockQ while harming rank1, within identical affordable workflow caps on 4 unbound cases?\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:hypothesis\",\"text\":\"Denser search recovers better candidates, but fixed scoring can rank them poorly, separating best50 gains from rank1 losses.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_lever\",\"text\":\"At 54000 rotations, best50 gains exceed 0.01 DockQ plus noise, while rank1 can decline, within common caps.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_not\",\"text\":\"At 54000 rotations, best50 gains fail 0.01 DockQ plus noise, or complete searches exceed common caps; rank1 changes remain separate.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:test_summary\",\"text\":\"Build gated docking/evaluation controller; validate independent scorer and CPU/GPU standard agreement; calibrate complete-workflow caps; seal rules; run 2 paired 3600/54000-rotation bundles on 4 cases, retaining 50. Report rank1, best50, time, GPU activity and billed cost separately.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:closest_prior\",\"text\":\"MEGADOCK 4.0 timed 1000000 docking jobs; rotation count was unspecified, without this fixed50 recovery-versus-ranking comparison. [prior]\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"prior\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4221127/\",\"quote\":\"In this simulation, a half million docking jobs required 5.71 h, while a million jobs required 11.51 h.\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:left_open\",\"text\":\"Whether 54000 rotations improve best50 while harming rank1 on these 4 apo cases, within calibrated common workflow budgets.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:anchor\",\"text\":\"Reproduce public DockQ example, then cross-check independent DockQ against primary evaluation before scoring study poses. [dockq]\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"dockq\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wallnerlab/DockQ\",\"quote\":\"Total DockQ over 3 native interfaces: 0.653 with BAC:ABC model:native mapping\"}],\"value\":0.653}
{\"ref\":\"card:limits\",\"text\":\"Only 4 exposed cases; prospective replication, no biological efficacy or population inference. No reranking, CPU dense comparison, extra retained poses, or new parallel algorithm.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"src:dockq\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wallnerlab/DockQ\",\"quote\":\"Total DockQ over 3 native interfaces: 0.653 with BAC:ABC model:native mapping\",\"supports\":\"Independent scorer's public example anchor and explicit mapping interface. Resolve immutable revision during offline contract creation.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:prior\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4221127/\",\"quote\":\"In this simulation, a half million docking jobs required 5.71 h, while a million jobs required 11.51 h.\",\"supports\":\"Open published MEGADOCK throughput result retrieved by web search; different hardware/workload, not a runtime proxy for this pilot. No rotation-axis maximum established.\"}

Return only one JSON value, with no other text, that matches this JSON Schema:
{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"One entry per item sent, with its ref unchanged.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"\\"card:<field>\\", \\"src:<source id>\\", \\"num:<number id>\\" or \\"rate:<rate id>\\", as sent.\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"SUPPORTED\",\"PARTIAL\",\"UNSUPPORTED\",\"CONTRADICTED\",\"UNREACHABLE\"]},\"page_quote\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The text on the page this status rests on.\"},\"note\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"page_value\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"num and rate items: the value the page states.\"}},\"required\":[\"ref\",\"status\",\"page_quote\",\"note\"]}}},\"required\":[\"items\"]}"
